// Candidate native map leaf: RAX map offset, R8 key offset, R9 payload,
// RDI mode (0 has,1 get,2 set,3 remove), RSI result optional tag.
// Caller validates map/key membership and exact tags and set payload.
// Map has 129 pairs: length/ready, 64 key/ready and payload/ready pairs.
// Removal preflights suffix readiness, moves entries in order, clears tail.
// keys entry accepts RAX map offset; preflights key membership and capacity,
// copies key handles into a fresh 257-pair string list, preserving order.
// RAX=result, RDX=status. RBX/RBP/R12/R14/R15 preserved; R13 advances
// on get/keys. Trusted mapped monotonic arena, single-threaded, noncanonical.
// Entries at offsets 0 and 663, shared private guard at offset 950.
import "ccam_aggregate_native_record_boundary.cap";

